{
  "name": "Wedding - Send Invitations",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Send personal invitations\n\nSends each guest in the **wedding_guests** Data Table their own link over WhatsApp (WAHA), then fills **invite_sent_at**. Guests already marked sent, or without a usable phone number, are skipped, so it is safe to run again.\n\n1. Create the Data Table (columns in n8n/README.md).\n2. Edit **Settings** (site URL, WAHA session, message wording).\n3. On **Send WhatsApp**, attach a Header Auth credential: name `X-Api-Key`, value = your WAHA_API_KEY.\n4. Click **Execute workflow**.",
        "width": 520,
        "height": 300
      },
      "id": "6df69d4b-5479-42d1-b8f6-ed62ea43c2ce",
      "name": "Note 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -640,
        -300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "8d7ddadd-12b6-427e-8c86-53e40722043d",
      "name": "Execute workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -640,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "// The only place to edit before sending. Everything else in this workflow reads from here.\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    // Where the invitation website is published. \"?invite=<token>\" is added for each guest.\n    siteUrl: 'https://REPLACE-WITH-YOUR-INVITATION-SITE/',\n    // WAHA as n8n reaches it. In the Docker stack this is the service name.\n    wahaUrl: 'http://waha:3000',\n    // The WAHA session that is logged in to the sending WhatsApp number.\n    wahaSession: 'REPLACE_WITH_WAHA_SESSION_NAME',\n    // {{title}} falls back to \"Bapak/Ibu\" when the guest has no title. Replace this wording.\n    messageTemplate: 'Yth. {{title}} {{name}},\\n\\nBerikut undangan pernikahan kami:\\n{{link}}',\n  },\n}];\n"
      },
      "id": "6a90f151-bd73-4e94-bc94-0bfc6b9cef64",
      "name": "Settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -420,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "row",
        "operation": "get",
        "dataTableId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "wedding_guests"
        },
        "returnAll": true
      },
      "id": "a5d54ad2-5214-46f3-bc75-5f8010e11ea7",
      "name": "Get guests",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.dataTable",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        -200,
        80
      ],
      "alwaysOutputData": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "// One message per guest who has not been invited yet and has a usable phone number.\n// Phone numbers arrive as 08xx, +62, 62xx, with spaces or dashes: keep digits, turn a leading 0 into 62.\nconst settings = $('Settings').first().json;\nconst guests = $input.all()\n  .map((item) => item.json)\n  .filter((row) => row && row.id !== undefined && row.token && !row.invite_sent_at);\n\nconst messages = [];\nfor (const guest of guests) {\n  let phone = String(guest.phone || '').replace(/\\D/g, '');\n  if (phone.startsWith('0')) phone = `62${phone.slice(1)}`;\n  if (!/^62\\d{8,12}$/.test(phone)) continue; // no usable number: leave the row unsent\n  const joiner = settings.siteUrl.includes('?') ? '&' : '?';\n  const link = `${settings.siteUrl}${joiner}invite=${guest.token}`;\n  const text = settings.messageTemplate\n    .replaceAll('{{name}}', guest.name)\n    .replaceAll('{{title}}', guest.title || 'Bapak/Ibu')\n    .replaceAll('{{link}}', link);\n  messages.push({ json: { rowId: guest.id, name: guest.name, chatId: `${phone}@c.us`, text } });\n}\nreturn messages;\n"
      },
      "id": "67721880-dfd5-4a9e-9d80-86652748033e",
      "name": "Prepare messages",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        20,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "batchSize": 1,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b3bfae9c-1eac-44c5-9cf7-cac194b6a814",
      "name": "Loop Over Guests",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        240,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.wahaUrl }}/api/sendText",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "json",
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ chatId: $json.chatId, text: $json.text, session: $('Settings').first().json.wahaSession }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "fullResponse": true,
              "neverError": true
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "1d905d6f-7988-45cc-b0d4-ec5e350720e5",
      "name": "Send WhatsApp",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        460,
        160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "expression",
        "numberOutputs": 2,
        "output": "={{ $json.statusCode < 300 ? 0 : 1 }}"
      },
      "id": "bb8fc640-2987-487c-8877-0c8202233b45",
      "name": "Sent OK?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 3.2,
      "position": [
        680,
        160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "row",
        "operation": "update",
        "dataTableId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "wedding_guests"
        },
        "matchType": "allConditions",
        "filters": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "keyName": "id",
              "condition": "eq",
              "keyValue": "={{ $('Loop Over Guests').item.json.rowId }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "invite_sent_at": "={{ $now.toISO() }}"
          },
          "matchingColumns": [],
          "schema": [
            {
              "id": "invite_sent_at",
              "displayName": "invite_sent_at",
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "display": true,
              "type": "string",
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "1e5bd297-7472-4cf2-9311-e93ea3d5023d",
      "name": "Mark invite sent",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.dataTable",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        900,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resume": "timeInterval",
        "amount": "={{ 5 + Math.floor(Math.random() * 8) }}",
        "unit": "seconds"
      },
      "id": "9f9551c7-9594-49e5-9a92-28fa521cce52",
      "name": "Pause between messages",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        1120,
        100
      ]
    }
  ],
